  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Is that... a pyramid?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Its shape is nearly a perfect square pyramid...@but it's far larger than@the Pyramid of Khufu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "It's like a mountain...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "When did something that huge get here...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "There's no weathering on the surface, let alone damage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "So the Tronium Buster Cannon could erase the barrier,@but not punch through.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "There was nothing like that in the satellite photos@we saw of the <Garden of Baral>'s ruins.@When on earth did it...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Never mind how it was built.@I can guess whose doing it is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "Since no enemies have come out, losing the barrier@must have caught him off guard too.@If we're going in, now's the time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Yes. If only the commander would decide quickly...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Commander, I'll send the strike force into@the pyramid-shaped structure immediately.@Any objection?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Denied. As to how that structure is handled,@we'll ask the Joint Chiefs for instructions.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "(It's obvious the enemy is inside...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Until new orders come down,@all strike force units are to stand by on alert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Dissatisfied, Captain?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "No, sir. All strike force units will stand by on alert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "This intense negative will...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "I didn't sense it until a moment ago...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Yeah, it hit the moment the barrier vanished.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Could the Lamaris Kaana Debudedabide@captured be in there...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Yes, I think so.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Then we hit the jackpot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "N-Not that I'm all that happy about it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Hey, it saves us the trouble of looking for 'em.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Is that pyramid the <Dark Brain> remnants' lair,@the Dark Iron Castle?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "I wonder about that. Look at that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "See? It's just like Debudedabide's crest.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Did that creep have something like that on him?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "No doubt about it. Shoko's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "What d'you think, Roa?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "That isn't the Dark Iron Castle.@Debudedabide must have built it on his own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "On his own... Eh, whatever it is.@We'll storm it and smash it to bits.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Wait.@All units, entering the pyramid is forbidden@until we get orders from the Joint Chiefs.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Are you serious?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "(Good grief... Hope it doesn't end up too late.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Major Kai,@that fatso's in there for sure!@If we sit around...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "See?! He came out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Debudedabide",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Bwuhuuu~!@To think my barrier would be brokeeen~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "But I was lucky you didn't storm in@right awaaay. Could it be you lost@your nerve~?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "The thing is, he's not totally wrong...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Oh well. You showing up right now@works out nicely for meee.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "What...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Whoops, that was a slip of the tongue~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "You bastard, what are you planning,@hauling Lamaris into that pyramid?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "You don't need to know thaaat~.@I'll settle this right heeere~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Like hell, that's my line!@Don't you budge from there!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Commander, the strike force will intercept the enemy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Very well, but entering the pyramid-shaped@structure is forbidden until the Joint Chiefs@give the order.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units! Commence attack!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "(Bwuhuhun. Seems like they're a little sluggiiish.@But that buys me tiiime.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "(Just a little more, a little mooore~)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "That dumb clown ain't budgin' from there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Suits me fine.@I'll blast through the pyramid wall, him and all!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Hey, big brother! That's disobeying orders!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Shut it, I ain't a soldier!@Like I'm gonna just sit on my hands!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "That's what he's sayin', Major Kai...@You okay with that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "We have to take down Debudedabide@to rule out future trouble anyway.@I'll take responsibility. All units, go all out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Guhuhu, time I got serious~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "What're you talkin' about? You're the one losin'!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Yeah! What're your buddies doin'?!@Ain't they comin' to bail ya out?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "My glory belongs to meee~!@I'll defeat you and lock in my place@as the army's top executiveee~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "I won't let those guys act so big-headed~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Don't worry. When it comes to big heads, you win.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Sh-Shut uuup~!@I'll show you how terrifying I aaam!!",
