   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Oh my?@Were you self-conscious about your head size?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Bwuhuhu, I'll crush you!@I'll crush you aaall~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Like hell!@I ain't lettin' your big head swell any more!@Get ready!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "N-No waaay!@I-I, of all beings, beaten by the likes of theeem!!",
