   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Commander, a message from the Joint Chiefs.@We're to enter the pyramid-shaped structure@and investigate its interior.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Hm, the order came at a good time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "(Is that really so?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Send the strike force in and secure the pyramid-shaped@structure's interior. We'll investigate after that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Roger. Strike force, enter the pyramid-shaped@structure. Securing the interior.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Now then, what's the magic word to open the door?@Open sesame, I bet?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "The entrance has been visible all along. Moving in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Fatso!@This is the last we'll see of your freaky face@and your tricks!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "I'll throw those words right back at youuu~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Like hell!@What part of my face is freaky?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "I, Michiru Hanaten, am gonna@send ya off proper! Go cross the Sanzu River!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Foool~!@This is a desert, there's no river heeere~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Then go be a mummy or somethin', ya idiot!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "That pyramid will be your tombstone...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "That's my liiine~! I'll stomp you flaaat!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Now then, today's the grand finale@of your little magic show~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "You're the ones who'll end heeere~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "We won't let you use the Garden of Baral's@ruins any longer!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "I'm the master of this laaand~!@You lot, disappeeear~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "I'll defeat you and wipe out the Lamaris and Yokijin!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Bwuhu! Die here and become maliiice!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Whatever you're after, I'm takin' you down here!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Don't talk so biiig~! You're the ones who'll diiie~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Today's the last I'll see of that stupid mug of yours!@Get ready!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "You really think you can beat meee~?!@How naive can you geeet~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Space Beyond Lunar Orbit",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Dark Iron Castle - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "So Debudedabide got taken out.@All that big talk, and what a letdown.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Crystal Dragoon",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "He refused our help and schemed@to keep all the glory for himself.@He brought it upon himself.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Can't just leave it at that.@I don't care what happens to that idiot,@but his plan had somethin' to it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
